# 31. SECURE CODE REVIEW

When reviewing code ask:

### Input

Is user input trusted?

### Authorization

Can users access objects they shouldn't?

### Secrets

Are credentials hard-coded?

### Database

Are queries parameterized?

### Files

Can users control paths?

### Processes

Can users influence commands?

### Output

Could data reach an unsafe HTML/JS sink?

### Errors

Does the application reveal sensitive information?

