# 35. DEFENSIVE CODING VS VULNERABILITY SCANNING

| Defensive Coding | Vulnerability Scanning |
|---|---|
| Prevents weaknesses | Searches for weaknesses |
| Developer-focused | Security/testing-focused |
| During development | Testing/deployment |
| Secure design | Detection |
| Code review | Automated assessment |

Best security programs use both.

